#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:8
msgid "Extension and lifecycle APIs"
msgstr "扩展与生命周期 API"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:10
msgid ""
"These public headers describe framed data, explicit owners, retained clocks "
"and trusted mediation. Their declarations do not establish a board "
"connection, execution mode, kernel gateway or physical qualification. "
"Construction, memory ownership and final-access requirements remain part of "
"each contract."
msgstr ""
"这些公共头文件描述成帧数据、显式所有者、保留时钟和可信代理。其声明并不证明板级连接、执行模式、内核网关或物理资格验证。构造、内存所有权及最后访问要求仍属于各自合同。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:14
msgid "Explicit F407 entropy construction"
msgstr "显式 F407 熵源构造"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:16
msgid ""
"For an F407 assembly, explicitly call `nexus_add_stm32f407_entropy(target)` "
"and link that target at the product's composition site. It owns the unique "
"static RNG source and refuses a second constructor. The getter "
"`nx_stm32f407_entropy_instance()` returns an existing readonly face; it "
"performs no startup, register access or factory registration."
msgstr ""
"对于 F407 装配，显式调用 `nexus_add_stm32f407_entropy(target)`，并在产品装配处链接该目标。它拥有唯一静态 "
"RNG 源并拒绝第二个构造器。getter `nx_stm32f407_entropy_instance()` 返回已有只读接口；不执行启动、寄存器访问或"
" factory 注册。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:22
msgid ""
"After successful Platform startup, call "
"`nx_stm32f407_entropy_instance_start()` with exact validated Board/profile "
"`hse_hz` and `hclk_hz` facts. The implementation checks the live PLL48/HCLK "
"relationship and acquires only its RNG clock gate; it neither configures the "
"shared PLL nor starts Platform. The reviewed source choices are 8 MHz HSE or "
"16 MHz HSI. The product must preserve those clock dependencies through stop."
msgstr ""
"Platform 成功启动后，使用准确验证过的 Board/profile `hse_hz` 和 `hclk_hz` 事实调用 "
"`nx_stm32f407_entropy_instance_start()`。实现检查实时 PLL48/HCLK 关系，仅取得其 RNG "
"时钟门；不配置共享 PLL，也不启动 Platform。经过审查的时钟源选择为 8 MHz HSE 或 16 MHz HSI。产品必须将这些时钟依赖保持到"
" stop 完成。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:29
msgid ""
"Run start/stop from one privileged, unmasked, serialized task context. Join "
"every entropy consumer before `nx_stm32f407_entropy_instance_stop()`, and "
"require that stop to succeed before withdrawing Platform clocks. Failed "
"withdrawal retains the same owner and cleanup responsibility; retry stop "
"without resetting or rebinding its state. A stopped face remains valid and "
"rejects data calls with STATE. This explicit constructor is separate from "
"TOML typed-factory selection; neither it nor software RNG health checks "
"qualify physical min-entropy or HIL."
msgstr ""
"在单一特权、未屏蔽中断的串行任务上下文执行 start/stop。在 `nx_stm32f407_entropy_instance_stop()` "
"前等待全部熵使用方退出，并要求 stop 成功后才撤回 Platform 时钟。撤回失败时保留同一所有者与清理责任；重试 "
"stop，不重置或重新绑定状态。停止后的接口仍有效，数据调用返回 STATE。此显式构造器与 TOML typed-factory 选择分离；它及软件 "
"RNG 健康检查均不能证明物理最小熵或 HIL。"

