#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:41
msgid "Return the existing static source face without starting it."
msgstr "返回已有静态源接口，不启动源。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:41
msgid ""
"No allocation, register access, clock acquisition, locking or registration. "
"The face's private state belongs to the unique explicit constructor target. "
"Data calls use its shared provider table directly; a cold face reports STATE."
msgstr ""
"不分配、不访问寄存器、不取得时钟、不加锁或注册。接口私有状态属于唯一显式构造器目标。数据调用直接使用共享 provider 表；冷态接口返回 STATE。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:0
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:41
msgid "Stable readonly face, including while the source is stopped"
msgstr "稳定只读接口，源停止时仍有效"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:41
msgid "Start the explicit source after successful Platform startup."
msgstr "Platform 成功启动后显式启动源。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:41
msgid ""
"Privileged unmasked serialized task. One unique hardware RNG owner; a "
"repeated live start returns BUSY. No scheduler, Platform startup or clock-"
"profile change is implicit. A post-write IO may retain owned effects; stop "
"must succeed before releasing Platform clock resources or recovery state."
msgstr ""
"特权、未屏蔽中断的串行任务。唯一硬件 RNG 所有者；有效状态下重复 start 返回 BUSY。不隐式调度、启动 Platform "
"或变更时钟配置。写入后的 IO 错误可能保留已拥有的效果；释放 Platform 时钟资源或恢复状态之前必须 stop 成功。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:41
msgid ""
"[in] Exact validated Board/profile facts, copied during this call; "
"source/PLL48 dependency stays live until stop"
msgstr "[in] 准确验证过的 Board/profile 事实，本次调用中复制；源/PLL48 依赖保持有效到 stop"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:41
msgid "SUCCESS, CONTEXT, INVALID, BUSY, STATE, UNSUPPORTED or IO"
msgstr "SUCCESS、CONTEXT、INVALID、BUSY、STATE、UNSUPPORTED 或 IO"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:41
msgid "Stop the source before withdrawing Platform clock resources."
msgstr "撤回 Platform 时钟资源前停止源。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:41
msgid ""
"Privileged unmasked serialized task after source consumers have joined. Retry"
" the same stop on failed withdrawal; do not reset or rebind private state. "
"The existing static face remains valid and reports STATE while admission is "
"closed."
msgstr ""
"源使用方全部退出后，在特权、未屏蔽中断的串行任务执行。撤回失败时重试同一 stop；不得重置或重新绑定私有状态。现有静态接口保持有效，准入关闭时返回 "
"STATE。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:41
msgid "SUCCESS when stopped; IO retains failed cleanup ownership"
msgstr "停止完成时 SUCCESS；IO 保留失败清理的所有权"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:41
msgid "Exact Board/profile facts admitted against the live RCC."
msgstr "针对实时 RCC 准入的准确 Board/profile 事实。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:41
msgid ""
"First scope uses an 8 MHz reviewed HSE Board or the fixed 16 MHz HSI. These "
"values come from validated assembly facts, not guessed hardware. Start checks"
" exact PLL48 and HCLK; caller maintains the source/PLLQ/HCLK dependency until"
" stop."
msgstr ""
"首个范围使用经过审查的 8 MHz HSE Board 或固定 16 MHz HSI。这些值来自经过验证的装配事实，不猜测硬件。start 检查准确的 "
"PLL48 与 HCLK；调用方将源/PLLQ/HCLK 依赖保持至 stop。"

