#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"Zero-initialize before first acquisition. Keep this exact control live and "
"exclusively owned until release; copied tokens never authorize earlier reuse "
"or another instance."
msgstr "首次获取前清零初始化。释放前必须让这个精确控制对象保持存活并由唯一所有者持有；复制的令牌从不授权提前复用或操作另一个实例。"

