#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Serial framing whose complete units determine block geometry."
msgstr "串行成帧规则，其完整单位决定块的几何布局。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Position of useful sample bits in each stored slot container."
msgstr "每个存储时隙容器中有效采样位的位置。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Compute complete audio storage without touching payload."
msgstr "计算完整音频存储布局，不访问载荷。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded pure calculation. No format conversion, serializer "
"configuration or codec negotiation is performed."
msgstr "可在任务或 IRQ 中执行的有界纯计算。不执行格式转换、串行器配置或编解码器协商。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] Explicit framing, sample and stored slot geometry."
msgstr "[in] 显式成帧规则、采样参数和存储时隙的几何布局。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[out] Separate fresh output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立的新输出；拒绝时保持不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for incompatible framing or EXHAUSTED on arithmetic "
"overflow; never retains an input or allocates."
msgstr "成功返回 SUCCESS；成帧规则不兼容时返回 INVALID，算术溢出时返回 EXHAUSTED；从不保留输入或分配内存。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Check and copy planar/strided frame geometry."
msgstr "检查并复制平面式或带步长的帧几何布局。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"Bounded pure calculation. Pixel/color meanings remain with the selected "
"camera/display/DMA adapter."
msgstr "有界纯计算。像素和颜色的含义仍由所选相机、显示或 DMA 适配器负责。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] 1..NX_FRAME_MAX_PLANES immutable plane descriptions."
msgstr "[in] 1..NX_FRAME_MAX_PLANES 个不可变平面描述。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] Exact plane count, not a runtime pool maximum."
msgstr "[in] 精确平面数，并非运行时池的容量上限。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[out] Fresh output, unchanged on every rejection."
msgstr "[out] 新输出；任何拒绝都保持其不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for empty/overlapping/short-stride planes, or EXHAUSTED on "
"byte arithmetic overflow."
msgstr "成功返回 SUCCESS；平面为空、相互重叠或步长不足时返回 INVALID；字节数算术溢出时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Cold-bind a complete-frame layout to an existing queue."
msgstr "在冷构造阶段将完整帧布局绑定到既有队列。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"Task-only cold assembly, O(n squared) storage checks. No hardware or DMA-"
"domain admission is inferred. Keep all queue/control/payload storage live "
"through final stop."
msgstr ""
"仅供任务执行的冷构造，存储检查的复杂度为 O(n²)。不据此推断硬件或 DMA 域准入。全部队列、控制对象和载荷存储须保持存活，直至最终停止完成。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[out] Fresh control disjoint from queue and payloads."
msgstr "[out] 新控制对象，与队列及载荷均不重叠。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[inout] Initialized unborrowed queue with all slots free."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且未被借用的队列，全部时隙空闲。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] Checked complete-frame geometry, copied on success."
msgstr "[in] 已检查的完整帧几何布局，成功时复制。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for aliases/short buffers/bad layout, BUSY for outstanding "
"blocks or STATE while stopping."
msgstr "成功返回 SUCCESS；存在别名、缓冲区不足或布局无效时返回 INVALID；仍有未归还块时返回 BUSY；停止过程中返回 STATE。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Publish one complete frame after final producer access."
msgstr "生产者最后访问结束后，发布一个完整帧。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"Bounded task/IRQ metadata. Reserve/prepost/abort still use the existing "
"stream; publication always has exact frame size."
msgstr "可在任务或 IRQ 中执行的有界元数据操作。预留、预提交和中止仍使用既有流；发布大小始终等于精确帧大小。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[inout] Exclusive serialized producer binding."
msgstr "[inout] 独占且串行使用的生产者绑定。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] Existing stream producer loan, detached from all DMA."
msgstr "[in] 既有流的生产者借用，已从全部 DMA 脱离。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] Existing observed stream boundary flags."
msgstr "[in] 已观察到的既有流边界标志。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Existing stream result; rejection retains the fill loan."
msgstr "返回既有流的结果；拒绝时保留填充借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Publish one complete frame from the existing posted FIFO."
msgstr "从既有预提交 FIFO 发布一个完整帧。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Bounded task/IRQ metadata; preserves pending and FIFO counts."
msgstr "可在任务或 IRQ 中执行的有界元数据操作；保留待处理数和 FIFO 计数。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[inout] Same producer binding and complete-frame layout."
msgstr "[inout] 同一生产者绑定及完整帧布局。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[inout] Existing posted producer bound to this stream."
msgstr "[inout] 已绑定到此流的既有预提交生产者。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] Oldest pending loan, absent from all hardware targets."
msgstr "[in] 最早的待处理借用，已不在任何硬件目标中。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] Observed existing stream boundary flags."
msgstr "[in] 已观察到的既有流边界标志。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Existing posted-publication result, INVALID for foreign pool."
msgstr "返回既有预提交发布操作的结果；来自其他池时返回 INVALID。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Acquire the next complete immutable DMA consumer loan."
msgstr "获取下一个完整、不可变的 DMA 消费者借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ; output disjointness scans the fixed pool in O(n) before the O(1) "
"guarded queue operation. Output cannot alias queue controls or any full-"
"capacity pool payload. EMPTY creates no loan and never repeats a previous "
"frame. Caller owns silence/blanking/stop policy. Do not use retries as "
"additional observed boundaries."
msgstr ""
"可在任务或 IRQ 中调用。在带保护的 O(1) 队列操作前，以 O(n) "
"扫描固定池来检查输出不重叠。输出不得与队列控制对象或池内任何载荷的完整容量范围重叠。EMPTY "
"不创建借用，也从不重复上一帧。静音、消隐或停止策略由调用方负责。不得将重试计为额外观察到的边界。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"[inout] Same serialized consumer, one call per observed output boundary when "
"using underrun accounting."
msgstr "[inout] 同一串行消费者；使用欠载计数时，每个观察到的输出边界只调用一次。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[inout] Zero or previously released control, unchanged on error."
msgstr "[inout] 已清零或先前已释放的控制对象；出错时保持不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, EMPTY with saturating underrun count, BUSY for a live loan, INVALID "
"for output alias or STATE for an incomplete queued block."
msgstr ""
"成功返回 SUCCESS；EMPTY 时增加饱和欠载计数；仍有活动借用时返回 BUSY；输出存在别名时返回 INVALID；已入队块不完整时返回 "
"STATE。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Derive a strided byte rectangle from a live frame loan."
msgstr "从活动帧借用导出带步长的字节矩形。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ; an O(n) immutable-pool output check precedes the O(1) guarded view "
"calculation. Output cannot alias the loan, queue controls or any full-"
"capacity pool payload. The adapter checks pixel alignment, resource and DMA "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"可在任务或 IRQ 中调用。在带保护的 O(1) 视图计算前，以 O(n) "
"检查输出与不可变池不重叠。输出不得与借用控制对象、队列控制对象或池内任何载荷的完整容量范围重叠。像素对齐、资源及 DMA 域由适配器检查。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] Exact live immutable DMA consumer loan."
msgstr "[in] 精确、活动且不可变的 DMA 消费者借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] Plane index in the bound layout."
msgstr "[in] 已绑定布局中的平面索引。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] Byte column within a row, not a pixel count."
msgstr "[in] 行内字节列偏移，并非像素数。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] First complete row."
msgstr "[in] 起始完整行。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] Positive bytes per selected row."
msgstr "[in] 每个选中行的正数字节数。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[in] Positive selected row count."
msgstr "[in] 选中的正数行数。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[out] Fresh output unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 新输出；失败时保持不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for out-of-plane rectangles or STATE for stale/foreign "
"loans; no DMA access begins here."
msgstr "成功返回 SUCCESS；矩形超出平面时返回 INVALID；借用身份陈旧或来自其他实例时返回 STATE；此处不启动 DMA 访问。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Release only after the adapter proves final DMA access."
msgstr "只有适配器证明 DMA 最后访问结束后才能释放。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"Bounded task/IRQ metadata. Timeout/cancel is not quiescence; failed drain "
"retains the queue borrow, including during stop. This helper checks proof "
"facts and does not stop hardware."
msgstr ""
"可在任务或 IRQ 中执行的有界元数据操作。超时或取消不代表静止；排空失败会保留队列借用，停止过程中也不例外。此辅助函数检查证明事实，不停止硬件。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[inout] Original owner; another instance cannot release."
msgstr "[inout] 原始所有者；另一个实例不能释放。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "[inout] Exact acquired control, cleared only on success."
msgstr "[inout] 精确获取的控制对象，仅在成功时清除。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"[in] Actual provider observations of engine, IRQ and peripheral quiescence; "
"counter completion alone is not proof."
msgstr "[in] 提供方对引擎、IRQ 和外设静止状态的实际观测；单凭计数器完成不构成证明。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, BUSY while any source remains, STATE for stale or foreign tokens, or"
" INVALID for impossible drain counters."
msgstr ""
"成功返回 SUCCESS；任何访问源尚未退出时返回 BUSY；令牌身份陈旧或来自其他实例时返回 STATE；排空计数不可能成立时返回 INVALID。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Immutable audio memory format, independent of codec policy."
msgstr "不可变音频内存格式，独立于编解码器策略。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"PCM frames store every slot, including inactive slots, in ascending slot "
"order; slot_bits is the container width. I2S has two 16/32-bit slots; SAI has"
" 1..32 8/16/32-bit slots. PDM has 1..8 byte-interleaved lanes; each byte "
"holds eight successive bits of one lane, so frames must divide by eight. "
"active_slots selects valid lanes/slots without compacting storage. Sample "
"byte order is explicitly declared."
msgstr ""
"PCM 帧按时隙升序存储每个时隙，包括非活动时隙；slot_bits 是容器位宽。I2S 有两个 16/32 位时隙；SAI 有 1..32 个 "
"8/16/32 位时隙。PDM 有 1..8 条按字节交错的通道；每个字节保存同一通道连续的八个位，因此帧数必须能被八整除。active_slots "
"选择有效通道或时隙，不压缩存储布局。采样字节序须显式声明。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "One plane; the last row needs no trailing stride padding."
msgstr "一个平面；最后一行无需尾随的步长填充。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"row_bytes/stride are bytes, rows is a complete line count. A plane occupies "
"(rows - 1) * stride + row_bytes bytes."
msgstr ""
"row_bytes 和 stride 的单位为字节，rows 为完整行数。一个平面占用 (rows - 1) * stride + row_bytes "
"字节。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Immutable frame geometry copied into a bound stream."
msgstr "复制到已绑定流中的不可变帧几何布局。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"Plane intervals, including inter-row padding, cannot overlap. bytes is the "
"exact maximum plane end, not summed row bytes. Audio formats are separate "
"immutable caller metadata; this layout represents their checked complete-unit"
" storage."
msgstr ""
"各平面的区间（包括行间填充）不得重叠。bytes "
"是最远平面末端的精确位置，并非各行字节数之和。音频格式是独立、不可变的调用方元数据；此布局表示经检查的完整单位存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Caller-owned binding; the existing stream owns every queue."
msgstr "调用方拥有的绑定；全部队列均由既有流拥有。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid ""
"Initialize before publication. One serialized producer and consumer use "
"framed publish/acquire exclusively until stop. Hardware, queue capacity and "
"synchronization remain explicit."
msgstr "发布前初始化。一个串行生产者和一个串行消费者始终使用成帧发布与获取接口，直至停止。硬件、队列容量及同步方式仍须显式提供。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:49
msgid "Checked 2D byte rectangle for an explicit DMA adapter."
msgstr "供显式 DMA 适配器使用的已检查二维字节矩形。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:55
msgid "spi_dma_owner.h"
msgstr "spi_dma_owner.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "Optional typed whole-CS SPI executor for bounded BusOwner."
msgstr "面向有界 BusOwner 的可选类型化完整片选区间 SPI 执行器。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "Bind a fresh executor without opening hardware or admission."
msgstr "绑定新执行器，不开启硬件或准入。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid ""
"Task-only, all lifecycle users joined before replacement. Uses original "
"FIFO/slots/epochs; final provider terminal result survives late cancellation."
" Continue unique executor service during stop and quarantine. Hardware stop, "
"publisher join and observer join remain explicit external steps."
msgstr ""
"仅供任务调用；替换前须让全部生命周期使用者完成会合退出。沿用原始 FIFO、时隙和 "
"epoch；提供方最终终止结果不受晚到取消影响。停止和隔离期间继续由唯一执行器推进。硬件停止、发布者会合退出和观察者会合退出仍是显式外部步骤。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "[inout] Zero fresh storage, distinct from capability/face."
msgstr "[inout] 已清零的新存储，与能力对象及接口对象均不重叠。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "[in] Initialized bus exclusively serviced by this owner."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化且仅由此所有者推进的总线。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "Executor for nx_bus_owner_init, zero port on invalid input."
msgstr "供 nx_bus_owner_init 使用的执行器；输入无效时返回全零端口。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "Check typed storage, then use bounded owner admission."
msgstr "检查类型化存储，再使用有界所有者准入。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid ""
"The request has an absolute deadline including queue time. Task multi-"
"producer checks run outside the metadata guard. There is no capacity scan, "
"allocation, OS lock or worker. One operation has one CS interval with allowed"
" SCK gaps. Schedule bounded service even when hints fail. Waiters never "
"service the shared controller. Queued provider failures settle later without "
"converting admission into rejection."
msgstr ""
"请求使用包含排队时间的绝对期限。任务级多生产者检查在元数据保护区外执行。不扫描容量，不分配内存，也不创建 OS 锁或工作线程。一次操作对应一个 CS "
"区间，允许其中出现 SCK 间隙。即使提示通知失败，也须调度有界推进。等待者从不推进共享控制器。已排队请求的提供方失败随后结算，不把已接受准入改判为拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "[inout] Owner with this exact typed executor."
msgstr "[inout] 装配此精确类型化执行器的所有者。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "[inout] Prepared READY outer request."
msgstr "[inout] 已准备好的 READY 外层请求。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "[in] Immutable chain through outer SETTLED."
msgstr "[in] 不可变链，保持至外层请求进入 SETTLED。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "[in] Optional static caller hint, or NULL."
msgstr "[in] 可选的静态调用方提示端口，或 NULL。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "[out] Stable slot/epoch identity on SUCCESS."
msgstr "[out] SUCCESS 时返回稳定的时隙/epoch 身份。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "SUCCESS means ACCEPTED; failure retains nothing."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED；失败不保留任何内容。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "Caller-owned queued and active SPI chain."
msgstr "调用方拥有的已排队或活动 SPI 链。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid ""
"The outer deadline includes queue residence. The chain, descriptors and all "
"TX/RX or fixed cells stay borrowed until acquire-observed outer SETTLED. "
"Counts and results use words."
msgstr ""
"外层期限包含排队停留时间。链、描述符以及全部 TX/RX 缓冲区或固定存储单元保持被借用，直至以 acquire 语义观察到外层 "
"SETTLED。计数和结果以字为单位。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:57
msgid "Selected-only exact metadata; no queue, payload copy or worker."
msgstr "仅为所选实例提供的精确元数据；不添加队列、载荷复制或工作线程。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:63
msgid "mapped_storage.h"
msgstr "mapped_storage.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Bounded read mappings and exclusive storage requests."
msgstr "有界只读映射与独占存储请求。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Read-only consumers; capability does not prove physical routing."
msgstr "只读消费者；能力声明不证明物理布线。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Physical mutation, separate from read-map ownership."
msgstr "物理修改操作，与只读映射所有权分离。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Prepare unborrowed caller storage without accessing payload."
msgstr "准备未被借用的调用方存储，不访问载荷。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE; no retained references on failure."
msgstr "成功返回 SUCCESS，否则返回 INVALID/STATE；失败不保留引用。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Query immutable geometry without starting hardware."
msgstr "查询不可变几何参数，不启动硬件。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Acquire one bounded, positive read-only span on a serialized executor."
msgstr "在串行执行器上获取一个有界、长度为正的只读范围。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid ""
"SUCCESS or INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/BUSY/EXHAUSTED/STATE. Rejection retains no "
"loan. Live read maps exclude all command/program/erase/cache/DMA writers. "
"CPU/XIP/DMA consumers may run concurrently after successful acquisition."
msgstr ""
"返回 SUCCESS 或 "
"INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/BUSY/EXHAUSTED/STATE。拒绝不保留借用。活动只读映射排斥全部命令、编程、擦除、缓存及 DMA "
"写入者。成功获取后，CPU/XIP/DMA 消费者可以并发运行。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Release an exact live loan after its consumers have joined."
msgstr "消费者全部会合退出后，释放一个精确的活动借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID/STATE, or backend unmap error retaining the loan. Task-only,"
" same serialized executor; no forced revocation or timeout release."
msgstr ""
"返回 SUCCESS、INVALID/STATE，或保留借用的后端解除映射错误。仅供任务调用，使用同一串行执行器；不强制撤销借用，也不因超时释放。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Admit one exclusive PROGRAM/ERASE request with an absolute deadline."
msgstr "以绝对期限接纳一个独占 PROGRAM/ERASE 请求。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid ""
"SUCCESS is ACCEPTED, possibly settled. Rejection retains no request or "
"payload and produces no hardware effects. No map loan may remain live. Task-"
"only serialized owner; no workers, allocation, locks or queue exist."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 表示 "
"ACCEPTED，请求可能已经完成结算。拒绝不保留请求或载荷，也不产生硬件效果。不得仍有活动映射借用。仅供串行任务所有者使用；不创建工作线程、内存分配、锁或队列。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Request cancellation by instance and nonrepeating writer epoch."
msgstr "通过实例及不重复的写入 epoch 身份请求取消。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid ""
"SUCCESS starts/observes drain; STATE rejects stale/foreign identity. "
"Cancellation never releases storage. Continue service through drain."
msgstr "SUCCESS 表示启动或观察排空；STATE 拒绝过期或属于其他实例的身份。取消从不释放存储。须继续推进，直至排空结束。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Advance one bounded backend step or drain attempt without waiting."
msgstr "不等待地推进一次有界后端步骤或排空尝试。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid ""
"Backend/IRQ/data references detach before release-publication of SETTLED, "
"which is the final request access. Failed drain is QUARANTINED; storage "
"remains borrowed and later service may retry source withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"在以 release 语义发布 SETTLED 前，后端、IRQ 和数据引用全部脱离；该发布是对请求的最后访问。排空失败进入 "
"QUARANTINED；存储继续被借用，后续推进可以重试撤回访问源。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Close admission and request writer cancellation."
msgstr "关闭准入并请求取消写入操作。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after all map loans and writer sources are gone; BUSY retains "
"storage and needs release/service. Repeated successful stop performs no "
"backend operation. The owner cannot restart or revoke loans."
msgstr ""
"只有全部映射借用与写入访问源均已退出才返回 SUCCESS；BUSY "
"保留存储，仍需释放借用或继续推进。成功停止后的重复调用不执行后端操作。此所有者不能重启或撤销借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Exact byte geometry; units divide size and one another."
msgstr "精确字节几何参数；各单位须整除总大小，且彼此满足整除关系。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Caller-owned request and input, borrowed through SETTLED."
msgstr "调用方拥有的请求及输入，保持被借用至 SETTLED。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid ""
"Initialize base before prepare. PROGRAM borrows length input bytes; ERASE "
"requires NULL input. Geometry alignment is checked at admission. Partial "
"effects survive cancellation, timeout and I/O failure. No replay."
msgstr ""
"准备前先初始化 base。PROGRAM 借用 length 个输入字节；ERASE 要求输入为 NULL。几何对齐在准入时检查。取消、超时或 I/O "
"失败都不会撤销已产生的部分效果。不得重放。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Stable instance-bound identity of one read mapping."
msgstr "一个只读映射的稳定实例绑定身份。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid ""
"Fields are immutable until release. Data stays read-only. Join every CPU, XIP"
" instruction fetch and DMA reader before release; a copied token grants no "
"additional loan. A failed release retains cleanup responsibility; readers "
"remain joined and must not resume access through the view. The portable owner"
" closes admission and permits release/stop cleanup retry."
msgstr ""
"字段在 release 前不可变。数据保持只读。Release 前须 join 每个 CPU、XIP 指令取指和 DMA 读取者；复制 token "
"不授予额外借用。Release 失败会保留清理责任；读取者必须保持已 join，不得通过该 view 恢复访问。可移植 owner 关闭准入，并允许重试 "
"release/stop 清理。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Stable writer identity; drain controls before reuse or destruction."
msgstr "稳定的写入身份；复用或销毁前须排空控制请求。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Shared immutable operations; every callback receives instance state."
msgstr "共享不可变操作表；每个回调都接收实例状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:65
msgid "Immutable face; context and all retained storage outlive users."
msgstr "不可变接口对象；上下文及全部保留存储必须比使用者存活更久。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:71
msgid "mapped_storage_owner.h"
msgstr "mapped_storage_owner.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:73
msgid "Explicit portable mapped-storage constructor and storage."
msgstr "显式、可移植的映射存储构造器及存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:73
msgid "Bind unused explicit storage without hardware or payload access."
msgstr "绑定未使用的显式存储，不访问硬件或载荷。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:73
msgid ""
"SUCCESS or INVALID; zero capacity, overlapping metadata/aperture, overflowing"
" spans, inconsistent units and missing callbacks reject. Caller constructs a "
"const face with owner_ops and this owner context."
msgstr ""
"返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID；容量为零、元数据与映射窗口重叠、跨度溢出、单位不一致或缺少回调时拒绝。调用方使用 owner_ops "
"和此所有者上下文构造 const 接口对象。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:73
#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "变量"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:73
msgid "One read-only method table shared by every portable owner instance."
msgstr "全部可移植所有者实例共享的一张只读方法表。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:73
msgid "Private provider boundary; immutable callbacks and independent context."
msgstr "私有提供方边界；回调不可变，上下文独立。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:73
msgid ""
"Context is one explicitly sized private state span. Geometry and mapped "
"address stay fixed. map SUCCESS establishes the readable aperture; map "
"failure leaves no effects. unmap SUCCESS proves all aperture/cache references"
" withdrawn; failure retains the last map loan and closes reader/writer "
"admission. Readers remain joined after a release attempt; a retained loan "
"authorizes cleanup retry, not renewed access. start is called only after "
"request admission and mapping exclusion. start errors may have effects and "
"always proceed through drain. poll advances bounded work, returns BUSY or a "
"terminal result, and supplies monotonically increasing completed bytes. "
"cancel initiates withdrawal but proves no drain. drain SUCCESS detaches every"
" hardware/IRQ/cache/DMA/descriptor/data source; BUSY retains ownership, other"
" errors quarantine it. No callback retains the request itself. "
"Command/cache/DMA writers outside these callbacks are forbidden while the "
"owner exists. Physical adapters own cache-line domains, XIP execution "
"exclusion and hardware-specific drain proof."
msgstr ""
"Context 是一个具有明确大小的私有状态区间；几何和映射地址保持固定。map SUCCESS 建立可读窗口；map 失败不产生效果。unmap "
"SUCCESS 证明全部窗口/cache 引用已撤回；失败保留最后一个映射借用，并关闭读者/写入者准入。尝试 release 后，读取者必须保持已 "
"join；保留的借用只授权重试清理，不授权重新访问。start 仅在请求准入并排除映射后调用；start 错误可能已有副作用，必须继续 "
"drain。poll 推进有界工作，返回 BUSY 或终态结果，并提供单调增加的完成字节数。cancel 发起撤回，但不证明已排空。drain "
"SUCCESS 脱离全部硬件/IRQ/cache/DMA/描述符/数据来源；BUSY 保留所有权，其他错误保留隔离。Callback "
"不保留请求本身。Owner 存在期间禁止这些 callback 之外的命令/cache/DMA 写入者。物理适配器负责 cache-line 域、XIP "
"执行排除和硬件特定的排空证明。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:73
msgid "Exact caller-owned map capacity; fields belong to the owner."
msgstr "精确的调用方映射容量；各字段归所有者管理。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:73
msgid "Caller-owned state, published only after successful initialization."
msgstr "调用方拥有的状态，仅在初始化成功后发布。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:73
msgid ""
"All methods and controls use one serialized task executor. Consumers may use "
"their maps elsewhere, then join before release. No implicit IRQ guard or "
"cross-task synchronization is supplied. Keep state, slots, backend context, "
"clock and face alive through stop and control/consumer join."
msgstr ""
"全部方法和控制操作使用同一个串行任务执行器。消费者可以在其他执行上下文使用映射，但释放前须会合退出。不隐式提供 IRQ "
"保护或跨任务同步。状态、时隙、后端上下文、时钟和接口对象均须保持存活，直至停止及控制使用者与消费者会合退出。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:79
msgid "native_mapped_storage.h"
msgstr "native_mapped_storage.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:81
msgid "Caller-owned coherent Native NOR model with bounded steps."
msgstr "调用方拥有的一致性 Native NOR 模型，每步工作量有界。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:81
msgid "Construct an unused Native backend without modifying backing bytes."
msgstr "构造未使用的 Native 后端，不修改底层存储字节。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:81
msgid ""
"SUCCESS or INVALID. Only CPU_READ is supported; XIP and DMA tags reject. "
"Native coherent memory needs no cache maintenance. The portable owner still "
"excludes mappings from every modeled mutation and drain."
msgstr ""
"返回 SUCCESS 或 INVALID。仅支持 CPU_READ；XIP 和 DMA 标记均拒绝。Native "
"一致性内存无需缓存维护。可移植所有者仍保证映射与每一次建模修改及排空互斥。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:81
msgid "Independent Native backend state; never a physical Flash substitute."
msgstr "独立的 Native 后端状态，从不替代物理 Flash。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:81
msgid ""
"The model preserves supplied bytes, programs only 1-to-0, and erases to 0xff."
" One service changes at most quantum bytes. No implicit file, heap, thread, "
"DMA, executable aperture or durability claim exists. fault_after bounds "
"mutated bytes; SIZE_MAX disables the fault. hold_drain models live retained "
"sources and drain_error models failure to prove source withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"模型保留传入的字节，仅允许从 1 编程为 0，并擦除为 0xff。一次推进最多修改 quantum 个字节。不隐式创建文件、堆、线程、DMA "
"或可执行映射窗口，也不声称具有持久性。fault_after 限制已修改字节数；SIZE_MAX 禁用该故障。hold_drain "
"模拟尚存的保留访问源，drain_error 模拟无法证明访问源已撤回的失败。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:87
msgid "amp_ipc.h"
msgstr "amp_ipc.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Bounded epoch-safe unidirectional shared-memory loans."
msgstr "有界、以 epoch 防止旧身份复用的单向共享内存借用。"

