#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Explicit port-isolation unit; supported cache granules divide 64."
msgstr "显式端口隔离单元；支持的缓存粒度须能整除 64。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Publish one complete-cache-line payload span without copying."
msgstr "发布一个覆盖完整缓存行的载荷范围，不进行复制。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid ""
"Serialized owner Thread only, same rule for every API below. No waits, "
"allocation, scheduler, ISR or implicit worker. Outputs must not overlap any "
"live instance/lane storage. Producer must finish DMA/other writers before "
"this call."
msgstr ""
"仅供串行所有者 Thread 调用；下方全部 API 均遵守相同规则。不等待，不分配内存，不创建调度器、ISR "
"或隐式工作线程。输出不得与任何活动实例或通道存储重叠。生产者须在调用前结束 DMA 及其他写入者的访问。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid ""
"SUCCESS transfers a read-only borrow until exact ACK poll or successful "
"reset_join. Rejection retains nothing and does not publish. EXHAUSTED means "
"no reusable slot identity."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 转移只读借用，直至轮询到精确 ACK 或 reset_join 成功。拒绝不保留内容，也不发布。EXHAUSTED "
"表示没有可复用的时隙身份。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Acquire-observe an exact ACK; BUSY/IO/STATE retain the sender borrow."
msgstr "以 acquire 语义观察精确 ACK；BUSY/IO/STATE 均保留发送方借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Acquire one offer after descriptor/payload invalidation succeeds."
msgstr "描述符及载荷失效操作成功后，获取一个发布项。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Join the caller view, then publish its exact ACK."
msgstr "让调用方视图的全部使用者会合退出，再发布该视图的精确 ACK。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid ""
"Valid ticket invocation permanently joins local readers. IO or STATE retains "
"endpoint/slot storage; retry finish or use reset_join after closing. Stale "
"tickets change nothing."
msgstr ""
"使用有效票据调用即不可撤销地确认本地读取者已会合退出。IO 或 STATE 保留端点和时隙存储；可重试 finish，或关闭后使用 "
"reset_join。陈旧票据不改变任何状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Close admission; outstanding send/receive loans remain retained."
msgstr "关闭准入；未完成的发送和接收借用仍被保留。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Join a closed endpoint after all exact ACKs/local returns."
msgstr "全部精确 ACK 及本地归还完成后，让已关闭端点会合退出。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid ""
"BUSY, IO or STATE retain the unique owner. Success performs its final access "
"and unclaims the role. Storage cannot be reconstructed: boot/sequence "
"identities never reset here."
msgstr "BUSY、IO 或 STATE 保留唯一所有者。成功执行最后访问并释放该角色声明。不得重构存储：此处从不重置启动及序列身份。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Join after an explicit old-peer stop proof."
msgstr "在取得显式旧对端停止证明后会合退出。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid ""
"Closed endpoint required; receiver views must have been consumed by finish "
"first. Failed proof retains ALL sender loans and ownership. Success retires "
"this endpoint; any replacement uses a strictly newer nonzero boot epoch from "
"the external boot owner, never rollover/reuse."
msgstr ""
"要求端点已关闭；接收者视图必须先由 finish "
"消费。证明失败保留发送方的全部借用及所有权。成功后此端点退役；任何替代端点均须使用外部启动所有者提供的、严格更新的非零启动 epoch，绝不回绕或复用。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "One writer's isolated publication word; accesses use the port only."
msgstr "一个写入者的隔离发布字；仅通过端口访问。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Shared descriptor; offsets refer to the configured payload window."
msgstr "共享描述符；偏移量相对于已配置的载荷窗口。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Caller-owned shared slot with disjoint writer cache lines."
msgstr "调用方拥有的共享时隙，各写入者的缓存行互不重叠。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid ""
"Sender alone writes offer/published; receiver alone writes "
"receipt/acknowledged. All four units must be reachable by both CPUs. Cold "
"initialization precedes either endpoint."
msgstr ""
"仅发送方写 offer/published；仅接收方写 receipt/acknowledged。两个 CPU "
"均须能访问这四个单元。任一端点启动前须完成冷初始化。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Hardware/ownership boundary supplied by the integration."
msgstr "集成方提供的硬件与所有权边界。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid ""
"Every callback is synchronous, bounded and non-reentrant. claim grants the "
"unique role owner of this exact lane and atomically rejects a reused/non-"
"increasing local boot epoch, even after ordinary join. Its authoritative "
"hardware boot owner preserves this history across CPU resets; exhaustion "
"fails closed. Rejection has no effects. unclaim follows final join only and "
"never erases boot identity history. clean/invalidate cover exact complete "
"isolated cache lines, finish their architectural barriers, and may fail. A "
"failed clean MUST NOT publish a control word. acquire/release are infallible "
"atomic 32-bit coherent control operations: the port owns any control-cache "
"maintenance. They must order descriptor/payload access across both CPUs and "
"bus fabric. stopped proves the named old peer CPU, DMA, IRQ and all observers"
" can never access the lane or payload again. The context binds the exact "
"physical lane and peer execution epoch covered by stopped. An epoch "
"observation, cancel, deadline or elapsed timeout never supplies this proof. "
"No existing single-core SoC supplies it."
msgstr ""
"每个回调均同步、有界且不可重入。claim 授予此精确通道的唯一角色所有者，并以原子方式拒绝复用或未递增的本地启动 epoch，即使普通 join "
"已完成也不例外。其权威硬件启动所有者跨 CPU 复位保留此历史；耗尽时关闭接纳。拒绝不产生效果。unclaim "
"仅发生于最终会合退出后，且从不清除启动身份历史。clean/invalidate 覆盖精确、完整且隔离的缓存行，完成其架构屏障，并可能失败。clean "
"失败绝不能发布控制字。acquire/release 是不会失败的原子 32 位一致性控制操作：端口负责全部控制缓存维护。它们须跨两个 CPU "
"和总线互连，对描述符及载荷访问建立顺序。stopped 证明指定的旧对端 CPU、DMA、IRQ 及全部观察者从此再也不能访问通道或载荷。上下文绑定 "
"stopped 所覆盖的精确物理通道和对端执行 epoch。epoch 观测、取消、期限或已流逝的超时都不能提供此证明。现有单核 SoC 均不提供该证明。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Instance/boot/slot identity; endpoint outlives every ticket copy."
msgstr "实例、启动及时隙身份；端点须比每一份票据副本存活更久。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Receiver's borrowed read-only shared span."
msgstr "接收者借用的只读共享范围。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid ""
"Caller must join every local reader before finish. A valid finish invocation "
"consumes the caller view even when link acknowledgement fails; endpoint "
"storage remains retained."
msgstr "调用方须在 finish 前让每个本地读取者会合退出。有效 finish 调用会消费调用方视图，即使链路确认失败也不例外；端点存储仍被保留。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:89
msgid "Stable close identity; endpoint lives longer than all control copies."
msgstr "稳定的关闭身份；端点须比全部控制对象副本存活更久。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:95
msgid "amp_ipc_storage.h"
msgstr "amp_ipc_storage.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:97
msgid "Caller-owned endpoint configuration and retained loan state."
msgstr "调用方拥有的端点配置及保留借用状态。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:97
msgid "Claim and bind unused zero-initialized endpoint storage."
msgstr "声明并绑定未使用、已清零初始化的端点存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:97
msgid ""
"Serialized privileged owner Thread, before publication. Validates disjoint "
"spans and exact boot epochs before claim. Rejected construction has no "
"references or shared effects. The port must independently enforce unique "
"hardware/role ownership; this component contains no global registry."
msgstr ""
"由串行特权所有者 Thread 在发布前调用。claim 前校验范围互不重叠及精确启动 "
"epoch。构造拒绝不保留引用，也不产生共享效果。端口须独立强制唯一硬件及角色所有权；此组件不含全局注册表。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:97
msgid "Zero-initialized local state; no sharing with another endpoint."
msgstr "已清零初始化的本地状态；不与其他端点共享。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:97
msgid "One unidirectional lane and exact caller-owned storage."
msgstr "一条单向通道及精确的调用方存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:97
msgid ""
"Both boot words are externally published, monotonic nonzero epochs. Never "
"republish an old boot identity, including after a whole-device reset. The "
"boot owner must fail closed on exhaustion. Initial shared records/words are "
"zeroed or retained from older epochs, never edited while live. Wire and boot "
"words occupy separate complete 64-byte units. All shared spans align to "
"granule (power of two, 1..64). Payload size is a positive multiple of "
"granule. Configuration, callbacks and all supplied storage outlive final "
"join."
msgstr ""
"两个启动字均为外部发布、单调且非零的 "
"epoch。绝不重新发布旧启动身份，整机复位后也不例外。启动所有者须在耗尽时关闭接纳。初始共享记录及控制字须已清零，或保留自更早 "
"epoch；活动期间不得编辑。协议控制字和启动字分别占用独立、完整的 64 字节单元。全部共享范围按 granule 对齐，granule 为 1..64"
" 之间的二次幂。载荷大小是 granule 的正整数倍。配置、回调及全部传入存储均须保持存活，直至最终会合退出。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:103
msgid "stm32f407_handoff.h"
msgstr "stm32f407_handoff.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid "Exact F407 Flash-image transfer after explicit owner drain."
msgstr "显式所有者排空后的精确 F407 Flash 映像移交。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid "Construct the single static F407 handoff admission domain."
msgstr "构造唯一的静态 F407 移交准入域。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid ""
"Serialized privileged Thread, once before any consumer. No heap, hardware "
"writes, discovery or implicit startup. The caller enrolls every "
"platform/product execution, IRQ, DMA, observer and memory owner that can "
"outlive entry. Release a lease only after its actual join/drain."
msgstr ""
"由串行特权 Thread "
"在任何消费者启动前调用一次。不使用堆，不写硬件，不执行发现或隐式启动。调用方须登记每个可能在入口之后仍存活的平台或产品执行者、IRQ、DMA、观察者及内存所有者。租约仅在其实际会合退出或排空后释放。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid "[in] Positive bound on enrolled live tokens."
msgstr "[in] 已登记活动令牌数的正数上限。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT or STATE; never resets an epoch."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT 或 STATE；从不重置 epoch。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid "Return the existing single static admission domain."
msgstr "返回既有的唯一静态准入域。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid "Pure lookup; does not initialize, acquire or touch hardware."
msgstr "纯查询；不初始化、不获取租约，也不访问硬件。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid "Stable object identity, including before initialization."
msgstr "稳定对象身份，初始化前亦有效。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid "Validate stopped F407 state and tail-transfer to Flash."
msgstr "校验已停止的 F407 状态，并以尾跳转移交至 Flash。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid ""
"Selected STM32F407VET6/ZGT6 baremetal images only. Caller is privileged "
"Thread on MSP, PRIMASK=1, other masks clear. No scheduler may have started. "
"Stop the actual Platform, join all users and keep admission closed. An "
"unrelated empty domain cannot authorize transfer. Rejects active FP/lazy "
"preservation, partial CP10/11 permissions, MPU, ART, SysTick, "
"enabled/pending/active IRQs, non-HSI16/reset buses, peripheral/DMA gates, "
"busy Flash and retained System effects. Ordinary inactive CP10/11 permissions"
" from SystemInit are supported. Main SRAM is preserved; MSP is 8-aligned in "
"(0x20000000,0x20020000]. All 98 vectors fit exact observed and generated "
"Flash geometry. Reset PC is Thumb with its first halfword in Flash. Success "
"sets VTOR, disables CP10/11, sets CONTROL=0, PSP=0 and MSP, then branches to "
"PC with PRIMASK=1. This is a masked handoff entry. No RAM copy/clear, image "
"authentication/selection, device drain, clock change or physical "
"qualification occurs. Target owns RAM startup and resets controllers before "
"enabling gates. No old deadline survives transfer. Exclude NMI/HardFault, "
"debugger, DMA and other bus masters. Enrollment is caller policy; Platform "
"and product owners are never enrolled automatically. Rejection preserves "
"masks and performs no writable MMIO. Reading SysTick CTRL consumes COUNTFLAG "
"even if rejected."
msgstr ""
"仅支持所选 STM32F407VET6/ZGT6 裸机映像。调用方须为使用 MSP 的特权 "
"Thread，PRIMASK=1，其他屏蔽寄存器为零。不得已启动调度器。停止实际 "
"Platform，让全部使用者会合退出，并保持准入关闭。无关的空域不能授权移交。活动浮点状态或延迟保存、CP10/11 "
"权限不完整、MPU、ART、SysTick、已启用或挂起或活动的 IRQ、非 HSI16 时钟或非复位总线配置、外设或 DMA 门控、忙碌 Flash "
"及残留 System 效果均导致拒绝。支持 SystemInit 设置的普通未激活 CP10/11 权限。保留主 SRAM；MSP 须按 8 "
"字节对齐，且位于 (0x20000000,0x20020000]。全部 98 个向量须满足实际观察及生成配置确定的精确 Flash 几何范围。复位 PC "
"须为 Thumb，且首个半字位于 Flash。成功时设置 VTOR、禁用 CP10/11、设置 CONTROL=0、PSP=0 和 MSP，然后在 "
"PRIMASK=1 下跳转到 PC。这是保持中断屏蔽的移交入口。不复制或清除 "
"RAM，不认证或选择映像，不排空器件，不改变时钟，也不进行物理资格验证。目标映像负责 RAM "
"启动，并在启用门控前复位控制器。任何旧期限在移交后均不再有效。外部须排除 NMI/HardFault、调试器、DMA "
"及其他总线主设备。登记属于调用方策略；Platform 和产品所有者从不自动登记。拒绝时保留中断屏蔽状态，且不执行可写 MMIO 操作。即使拒绝，读取 "
"SysTick CTRL 也会消耗 COUNTFLAG。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid "[in] Closed, drained barrier from this exact domain."
msgstr "[in] 来自此精确域、已关闭且已排空的屏障。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid "[in] 512-aligned physical Flash vector address."
msgstr "[in] 按 512 字节对齐的物理 Flash 向量地址。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:105
msgid "Error before transfer; success never returns."
msgstr "移交前可能返回错误；成功时永不返回。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:111
msgid "user_io_async.h"
msgstr "user_io_async.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "Bounded copied UART user mediation."
msgstr "有界复制式 UART 用户代理。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "Authenticate and copy one bounded user gateway transaction."
msgstr "认证并复制一次有界用户网关事务。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"Privileged unmasked Thread, one serialized gateway executor. Authenticate the"
" current principal on every call. The trusted copy port supplies fault "
"containment and mapping stability; range checks alone prove neither. The "
"caller separately drives the existing BusOwner/UARTOwner; this call never "
"services it. CANCEL only requests its drain. CONSUME requires acquire SETTLED"
" and the existing owner's idle/join barrier, copies the reply first, then "
"wipes bytes/releases the exact cell. Failed reply copy, cancellation or "
"quarantine never releases an accepted cell. No SVC/CMSE entry or NS RTOS is "
"provided."
msgstr ""
"特权、未屏蔽中断的 "
"Thread，由唯一网关执行者串行调用。每次调用均认证当前主体。可信复制端口提供故障隔离和映射稳定性；仅范围检查不能证明两者。调用方另外推进既有 "
"BusOwner/UARTOwner；本调用从不执行其 service。CANCEL 仅请求其排空。CONSUME 要求以 acquire 观察 "
"SETTLED 及既有所有者的空闲／汇合屏障，先复制回复，再擦除字节并释放精确单元。回复复制失败、取消或隔离都不释放已接受单元。不提供 SVC/CMSE "
"入口或 NS RTOS。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "[inout] Trusted privileged binding and exact copied slots."
msgstr "[inout] 可信特权绑定及精确复制槽位。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "[in] Transient full readable user header, copied once."
msgstr "[in] 临时完整可读的用户头部，仅复制一次。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "[in] Transient readable SUBMIT bytes; NULL otherwise."
msgstr "[in] 临时可读的 SUBMIT 字节；其他情况为 NULL。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "[out] Transient disjoint full writable user reply."
msgstr "[out] 临时、互不重叠且完整可写的用户回复。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after reply copy; identity/span/protocol/copy/control errors "
"otherwise. No user address survives any return. A reply-copy error can follow"
" acceptance: POLL the proposed slot/epoch; duplicate SUBMIT cannot replay or "
"replace it."
msgstr ""
"回复复制后返回 SUCCESS；否则返回身份、跨度、协议、复制或控制错误。任何返回后均不保留用户地址。接受后仍可能发生回复复制错误：以 POLL "
"查询所提出的槽位／纪元；重复 SUBMIT 不得重放或替换它。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "Close copied admission and cancel this binding's live work."
msgstr "关闭复制接纳并取消此绑定的活动工作。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"Trusted privileged management, not a user gateway action. Same serialized "
"lifecycle executor as dispatch/join, except synchronous identity/copy "
"callbacks may request close. This is not a general concurrent cross-task "
"control API. Close is permanent; it does not close the underlying owner. No "
"worker or provider service runs here. Keep driving the owner and authenticate"
" POLL/CONSUME through normal dispatch. Identity/copy callbacks may request "
"close, never recursively dispatch or reconstruct. All bound storage stays "
"live."
msgstr ""
"可信特权管理操作，不是用户网关动作。与 dispatch/join 使用同一串行生命周期执行者，但同步身份／复制回调可以请求 "
"close。这不是通用的跨任务并发控制 API。关闭是永久的，但不关闭底层所有者。此处不运行工作线程或提供者 service。须继续推进所有者，并通过常规"
" dispatch 认证 POLL/CONSUME。身份／复制回调可以请求 close，但不得递归 dispatch 或重新构造。全部绑定存储保持存活。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "Privileged retirement after permanently lost user mappings."
msgstr "用户映射永久丢失后的特权回收。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"Same trusted serialized management as close/join; never an untrusted wire "
"action. The kernel decides when cleanup is authorized. First close/cancel and"
" separately drive the real owner. Every retained exact cell must acquire "
"SETTLED and the owner must be idle. The trusted drained proof then fences "
"future gateway entries and joins all outer observers while retaining the "
"role. Only then are all copied payloads wiped and cells retired without user "
"copyout. Pending, quarantined or unjoined work retains every cell unchanged. "
"Success is idempotent and permanently rejects dispatch. It does not release "
"the role: successful join is still required before reclaiming any bound "
"storage. No forced borrow revocation, process-liveness policy or provider "
"service is supplied."
msgstr ""
"与 close/join 使用相同的可信串行管理；绝不是不可信的传输动作。由内核决定何时授权清理。先 "
"close/cancel，再另行推进真实所有者。每个保留的精确单元都必须以 acquire 观察 SETTLED，且所有者必须空闲。随后可信 "
"drained "
"证明阻止未来网关入口并汇合全部外部观察者，同时保留角色。只有此后才能擦除全部复制载荷并回收单元，无需向用户复制输出。待处理、隔离或未汇合的工作保留每个单元不变。成功具有幂等性，并永久拒绝"
" dispatch。它不释放角色：回收任何绑定存储前仍须成功 join。不提供强制撤销借用、进程存活策略或提供者 service。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "Join closed/consumed cells, owner and trusted gateway role."
msgstr "汇合已关闭／已消费单元、所有者及可信网关角色。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"Trusted serialized management. No reinitialization/reopen, hidden provider "
"stop or identity registry is created. A successful join permits a fresh "
"object with a larger claimed session; never reset or reconstruct this live "
"object."
msgstr ""
"可信串行管理。不创建重新初始化／重新打开、隐式提供者停止或身份注册表。成功 join 后，可由新对象申领更大的会话；不得重置或重新构造此活动对象。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after no gateway/copy, copied cell or owner publisher remains "
"and the trusted role release proves outer gateway observers joined; "
"BUSY/error retains role and storage."
msgstr ""
"仅在不再存在网关／复制、复制单元或所有者发布者，且可信角色释放证明外部网关观察者已汇合后返回 SUCCESS；BUSY 或错误均保留角色与存储。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "Twelve scalar local C gateway words; no principal, address or callback."
msgstr "十二个本地 C 网关标量字；不含主体、地址或回调。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"SUBMIT proposes the exact next nonzero 64-bit epoch for an explicit slot "
"within the exact claimed nonzero session and supplies positive length plus an"
" absolute deadline in the existing owner's clock domain. Other actions use "
"the accepted exact epoch and zero length/deadline words. device must match "
"the immutable trusted binding; reserved=0. Word pairs encode low then high "
"halves, independently of the compiler enum, pointer and uint64_t alignment "
"ABI. These are local C gateway records; an integrating kernel owns byte order"
" and any transport serialization."
msgstr ""
"SUBMIT 在精确已申领的非零会话内，为显式槽位提出精确下一个非零 64 "
"位纪元，并提供正数长度及既有所有者时钟域中的绝对截止时间。其他动作使用精确已接受纪元，长度／截止时间字均为零。device "
"必须匹配不可变可信绑定；reserved=0。字对按低半部、高半部编码，不依赖编译器枚举、指针或 uint64_t 的对齐 ABI。这些是本地 C "
"网关记录；字节序及任何传输序列化均由集成内核负责。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid "Ten initialized scalar words; no privileged pointer."
msgstr "十个已初始化标量字；不含特权指针。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:113
msgid ""
"state is a Core nx_request_state_t value encoded as uint32_t. Only SETTLED "
"has a final result/count; other results are BUSY with count zero. accepted=1 "
"denotes the retained copied cell, including a terminal error when the "
"existing owner rejects admission. No hardware effect follows from acceptance "
"alone."
msgstr ""
"state 为编码成 uint32_t 的 Core nx_request_state_t 值。仅 SETTLED 具有最终结果／计数；其他结果为 "
"BUSY，计数为零。accepted=1 表示保留的复制单元，包括既有所有者拒绝接纳时的终结错误。仅接受本身不产生硬件效果。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:119
msgid "user_io_async_storage.h"
msgstr "user_io_async_storage.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid "Trusted kernel assembly for exact copied UART user cells."
msgstr "针对精确复制 UART 用户单元的可信内核装配。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid "Nominal copy permissions; actual access still requires trusted copy."
msgstr "名义复制权限；实际访问仍须经过可信复制。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid "Cold construct one exact copied mediation over a real owner."
msgstr "在真实所有者之上初始构造精确复制代理。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid ""
"Privileged unmasked Thread with owner idle and no concurrent users. Cold O(n "
"squared) alias checks reject all known mutable cell/payload/control overlaps "
"and user-RAM aliases. Admission checks fixed region extents and copies at "
"most the selected exact payload budget; no queue or worker is added. Keep "
"policy, cells, owner, provider and all contexts stable through permanent "
"close, consumption and successful join. Pure cold checks precede a "
"constructing reservation and the trusted role claim; no fallible step follows"
" successful claim. Fresh objects require a larger externally claimed session;"
" this object cannot be reconstructed to reset its epochs."
msgstr ""
"特权、未屏蔽中断的 Thread，所有者空闲且没有并发使用者。初始 O(n squared) 别名检查拒绝全部已知可变单元／载荷／控制重叠及用户 RAM "
"别名。接纳检查固定区域范围，复制量不超过所选精确载荷预算；不增加队列或工作线程。策略、单元、所有者、提供者及全部上下文须在永久关闭、消费直至成功汇合期间保持稳定。纯初始检查先于构造保留及可信角色申领；成功申领后不再有可失败步骤。新对象须从外部申领更大的会话；不得重新构造此对象以重置纪元。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid "[out] Fresh zero privileged storage, initialized once."
msgstr "[out] 全新零初始化的特权存储，仅初始化一次。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid "[inout] Exact caller-owned cells/payloads, no maximum pool."
msgstr "[inout] 调用方拥有的精确单元／载荷，不设最大存储池。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid "[in] Positive cell count representable in a scalar slot ID."
msgstr "[in] 能以标量槽位 ID 表示的正数单元数量。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid "[in] Immutable trusted principal/grant/copy/owner binding."
msgstr "[in] 不可变可信主体／授权／复制／所有者绑定。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid ""
"SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT/BUSY/EXHAUSTED, or trusted claim error "
"without new retained users or hardware effects; every rejected output remains"
" unchanged."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS 或 "
"INVALID/STATE/CONTEXT/BUSY/EXHAUSTED，或可信申领错误；不新增保留的用户引用或硬件效果；拒绝时每个输出均保持不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid "Nominal actual user RAM; trusted copy still enforces real access."
msgstr "名义上的实际用户 RAM；真实访问仍由可信复制强制检查。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid "Bounded trusted kernel identity and fault-contained copies."
msgstr "有界可信内核身份及具有故障隔离的复制。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid ""
"identity authenticates the current entry, never user input. Copy operations "
"guarantee complete checked CPU access and mapping/process lifetime for the "
"callback duration. Neither success nor error retains a user address, kernel "
"scratch pointer, mapping or observer after return. Errors may have partially "
"copied bytes; the copied payload cell is wiped on rejection, and reply "
"failure is recoverable through exact slot/epoch. No callback blocks, "
"dispatches recursively, or substitutes a permission observation for fault-"
"safe copying. Identity/copy callbacks may close this mediation. A new "
"kernel/CMSE wrapper must actually establish these preconditions; this "
"component does not.              claim is a trusted exclusive role authority "
"for the actual              owner/controller binding. It rejects a second "
"live role even              with a larger session, and rejects reused/non-"
"increasing              nonzero sessions from persistent, nonwrapping history"
" across              fresh storage, process/device reset and reconstruction."
"              Failed claim retains no reference/effect. Successful claim"
"              permanently consumes that session and retains the exact role"
"              until release. release SUCCESS proves outer gateway/transport "
"observers joined and detaches all authority references; failure retains the "
"original role unchanged. drained SUCCESS permanently fences future outer "
"gateway entry and joins all gateway/transport observers, while the exact role"
" remains claimed. Failed drained preserves the role and every cell unchanged."
" It must not modify bound configuration, cell identities or requests. Claim, "
"release and drained are bounded and cannot recursively construct, dispatch, "
"close, reap or join. Context/history must remain live; no source code "
"implements this kernel authority, physical isolation, storage partition or "
"recovery policy. Alternate wrappers of one controller are not distinct roles."
msgstr ""
"identity 认证当前入口，绝不接受用户提供的身份。复制操作保证在回调期间完成全部经检查的 CPU "
"访问，并保证映射／进程生命周期。无论成功或错误，返回后均不保留用户地址、内核临时指针、映射或观察者。错误可能发生在部分字节已复制之后；拒绝时擦除复制载荷单元，回复失败可通过精确槽位／纪元恢复。任何回调都不得阻塞、递归"
" dispatch，或以权限观察替代故障安全复制。身份／复制回调可以关闭此代理。新的内核／CMSE "
"包装层必须真正建立这些前提；本组件不提供它们。claim "
"是针对实际所有者／控制器绑定的可信独占角色授权者。即使会话更大，也拒绝第二个活动角色；并依据跨新存储、进程／器件复位及重构保留的持久、不回绕历史，拒绝复用或不递增的非零会话。失败申领不保留任何引用或效果。成功申领永久消耗该会话，并保留精确角色直至释放。release"
" 返回 SUCCESS 证明外部网关／传输观察者已汇合，并分离全部授权引用；失败时原角色保持不变。drained 返回 SUCCESS "
"永久阻止未来外部网关入口，并汇合全部网关／传输观察者，同时精确角色仍被申领。drained "
"失败保留角色及每个单元不变。它不得修改绑定配置、单元身份或请求。claim、release 和 drained 有界，且不得递归 "
"construct、dispatch、close、reap 或 "
"join。上下文／历史必须保持存活；源码不实现此内核授权、物理隔离、存储分区或恢复策略。同一控制器的不同包装不构成不同角色。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid "Immutable trusted one-principal/one-device/one-owner grant."
msgstr "不可变可信的单主体／单设备／单所有者授权。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid ""
"This is kernel configuration, never copied from users. owner/executor/port "
"must be the already constructed exact BusOwner + UARTOwner bridge, with no "
"other direct producers or external request/payload observers. Completion "
"callbacks are not installed. All callback contexts remain privileged; "
"explicit extents cover their complete live controls. Guard, clock and wake "
"contexts may be the same trusted object. The caller owns actual UART startup,"
" hardware attribution, executor scheduling, clock/deadline domain and final "
"stop."
msgstr ""
"这是内核配置，绝不从用户复制。owner/executor/port 必须是已构造的精确 BusOwner + UARTOwner "
"桥接，不得有其他直接生产者或外部请求／载荷观察者。不安装完成回调。全部回调上下文保持在特权内存中；显式范围覆盖其完整活动控制。保护、时钟及唤醒上下文可以是同一可信对象。调用方负责实际"
" UART 启动、硬件归属、执行者调度、时钟／截止时间域及最终停止。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid "Exact privileged cell; initialize only data and capacity."
msgstr "精确特权单元；仅初始化 data 和 capacity。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid ""
"All other fields start zero and are mechanism-private after construction. "
"data is independent writable privileged RAM, capacity is its exact positive "
"byte budget, at most UINT32_MAX. No user pointer is ever assigned here. Core "
"identity epochs never wrap and survive consume/close; never copy or reset a "
"live cell. UARTOwner borrows operation/payload until real provider final "
"access, then user-result retention lasts until successful reply copy plus "
"joined CONSUME, or trusted joined reap. Epoch history survives both paths."
msgstr ""
"其他字段初始均为零，构造后为机制私有。data 是独立可写特权 RAM；capacity 是精确正数字节预算，最大为 "
"UINT32_MAX。此处绝不赋入用户指针。Core 身份纪元从不回绕，并在 consume/close "
"后保留；不得复制或重置活动单元。UARTOwner 借用操作／载荷直至真实提供者的最后访问，此后用户结果保留至回复复制成功且 CONSUME "
"已汇合，或可信 reap 已汇合。两条路径均保留纪元历史。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:121
msgid "Caller-owned trusted control; initialize once, never reset epochs."
msgstr "调用方拥有的可信控制；仅初始化一次，不得重置纪元。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:127
msgid "i3c_controller.h"
msgstr "i3c_controller.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Explicit bounded I3C discovery, transfers and event ownership."
msgstr "显式有界的 I3C 发现、传输及事件所有权。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Prepare unused metadata without retaining its payload."
msgstr "准备未使用的元数据，不取得载荷借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid ""
"Serialized owner Thread. DISCOVER has no payload or target. PRIVATE permits "
"1..65535 bytes. CCC permits only ENEC/DISEC broadcast/direct writes and "
"direct GETMWL/GETMRL/GETPID/ GETBCR/GETDCR/GETSTATUS reads, with exact "
"defined lengths. GETMRL uses two bytes, or three when confirmed BCR bit2 "
"advertises an IBI payload. Address-changing, HDR and controller-handoff CCCs "
"reject. All APIs require one serialized executor. Port and clock callbacks "
"must not reenter the core, invoke application code or mutate retained state. "
"No ISR, allocation, OS lock or worker. Absolute deadlines use the injected "
"clock."
msgstr ""
"由所有者 Thread 串行执行。DISCOVER 没有载荷或目标。PRIVATE 允许 1..65535 字节。CCC 仅允许 ENEC/DISEC "
"广播／定向写入，以及具有精确定义长度的定向 GETMWL/GETMRL/GETPID/GETBCR/GETDCR/GETSTATUS 读取。GETMRL "
"使用两字节；若已确认 BCR 的 bit2 声明 IBI 载荷，则使用三字节。拒绝改变地址、HDR 及控制器交接 CCC。全部 API "
"都要求唯一串行执行者。端口与时钟回调不得重入核心、调用应用代码或修改保留状态。不得在 ISR 中调用；不进行分配，不使用 OS "
"锁或工作线程。绝对截止时间使用注入的时钟。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Admit a finite operation after cold validation and readiness."
msgstr "经初始校验及就绪检查后接纳有限操作。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid ""
"SUCCESS transfers the borrow. Rejection has no effects or retained "
"references. Outputs cannot alias retained controller, port table, "
"target/event storage, policy, request or payload. Port and clock context "
"spans remain the caller's responsibility."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS "
"转移借用。拒绝不产生效果，也不保留引用。输出不得与保留的控制器、端口表、目标／事件存储、策略、请求或载荷形成别名。端口与时钟上下文范围仍由调用方负责。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Perform one bounded FIFO/event phase or one drain proof."
msgstr "执行一个有界 FIFO／事件阶段，或一次排空证明。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid ""
"Partial DAA, malformed observations and errors fault admission while "
"retaining every known/tentative assigned address. Cancel/timeout/failed drain"
" never release a loan. Failed quiescence stays QUARANTINED; continued service"
" may recover. An event overflow returns OVERFLOW and latches its counter, "
"without discarding an already retained queued event."
msgstr ""
"部分 DAA、畸形观察及错误使接纳进入故障状态，同时保留每个已知／暂定分配地址。取消、超时或排空失败绝不释放借用。静默证明失败时保持 "
"QUARANTINED；继续 service 可以恢复。事件溢出返回 OVERFLOW 并锁存计数，不丢弃已保留的队列事件。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Request withdrawal using stable epoch before request dereference."
msgstr "在解引用请求前，使用稳定纪元请求撤回。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Obtain only a confirmed target; tentative/retired records reject."
msgstr "仅获取已确认目标；拒绝暂定／已退役记录。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Copy one retained event; EMPTY leaves output unchanged."
msgstr "复制一个保留事件；EMPTY 时输出不变。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Copy saturating loss counters without clearing them."
msgstr "复制饱和丢失计数器，不清零。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Close admission without changing loans, target identities or events."
msgstr "关闭接纳，不更改借用、目标身份或事件。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Prove a whole-bus reset before invalidating dynamic addresses."
msgstr "使动态地址失效前，证明已完成整条总线复位。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid ""
"Requires closed admission. Hardware proof covers real wire, FIFO and IRQ "
"quiescence AND every target's dynamic address invalidated. Peripheral reset "
"or FIFO flush alone is never this proof. Failure preserves all loans and "
"address records. Success settles outstanding work and invalidates endpoints; "
"retained events preserve their old epochs for the caller."
msgstr ""
"要求接纳已关闭。硬件证明必须同时覆盖真实线路、FIFO、IRQ 静默，以及每个目标的动态地址均已失效。仅外设复位或 FIFO "
"清空绝不构成此证明。失败保留全部借用与地址记录。成功使未完成工作结算并使端点失效；保留事件仍携带旧纪元供调用方处理。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Reopen an idle unfaulted pause; faults require explicit bus reset."
msgstr "重新打开空闲且无故障的暂停；故障要求显式总线复位。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Close, withdraw and finally relinquish the unique controller."
msgstr "关闭、撤回，最后放弃唯一控制器。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid ""
"Active work or queued events return BUSY. Caller continues service, consumes "
"events and retries. Assigned/tentative addresses or a fault return STATE "
"until whole-bus reset proof invalidates them. Successful final wire/ FIFO/IRQ"
" quiescence releases ownership, never reconstructing this object. Storage "
"outlives copied endpoints and tickets."
msgstr ""
"活动工作或队列事件返回 BUSY。调用方须继续 service、消费事件并重试。存在已分配／暂定地址或故障时返回 "
"STATE，直至整条总线复位证明使其失效。最终真实线路／FIFO／IRQ "
"静默证明成功后释放所有权，不得重新构造此对象。存储须在所有复制的端点与票据存续期间保持有效。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Controller-bound confirmed target incarnation, never a factory ID."
msgstr "绑定到控制器的已确认目标代次，绝不是工厂 ID。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Stable operation identity; controller outlives all copied controls."
msgstr "稳定操作身份；控制器须在全部复制的控制存续期间保持有效。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Caller-owned finite operation; no implicit bus discovery."
msgstr "调用方拥有的有限操作；不隐式发现总线。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid ""
"Initialize base once with nx_request_initialize. Accepted metadata and "
"payload stay borrowed until acquire SETTLED. TX stays immutable; transferred "
"counts bytes handed to the FIFO, not acknowledged target effects. No replay "
"after errors. Public fields are immutable throughout an accepted borrow."
msgstr ""
"仅使用 nx_request_initialize 初始化 base 一次。已接受元数据和载荷保持借用，直至以 acquire 观察 SETTLED。TX"
" 保持不可变；transferred 统计交给 FIFO 的字节，而不是目标已确认的效果。错误后不重放。在整个已接受借用期间，公共字段均不可变。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Copied event; no callback, target creation or hidden work."
msgstr "复制的事件；不调用回调、不创建目标、不隐式执行工作。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid ""
"IBI endpoint retains its exact confirmed target epoch. Confirmed BCR bit1 "
"must advertise IBI. Bit2 requires 1..4 payload bytes including MDB; otherwise"
" zero data bytes. HOT_JOIN carries no endpoint and only requests explicit "
"caller-controlled discovery. Payload is at most four bytes, as in the "
"selected H563 reference; no timestamp claim."
msgstr ""
"IBI 端点保留精确已确认目标纪元。已确认 BCR 的 bit1 必须声明 IBI 能力。bit2 置位时要求 1..4 字节载荷且包含 "
"MDB；否则为零数据字节。HOT_JOIN 不携带端点，仅请求由调用方显式控制的发现。与所选 H563 参考一致，载荷最多四字节；不提供时间戳保证。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:129
msgid "Explicit loss accounting; counters saturate rather than wrap."
msgstr "显式丢失统计；计数器饱和而不回绕。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:135
msgid "i3c_controller_storage.h"
msgstr "i3c_controller_storage.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid "Caller storage and aggregate I3C hardware boundary."
msgstr "调用方存储及聚合 I3C 硬件边界。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid "Bind unused zero storage and claim one controller."
msgstr "绑定尚未使用且已零初始化的存储，并申领一个控制器。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid ""
"Reject overlapping/unaligned/overflowing storage, duplicate PIDs/addresses, "
"reserved I3C addresses and nonzero targets. The config value is copied and "
"need not remain alive; its referenced storage and contexts remain live and "
"separate from every request/payload/output. 48-bit PIDs are caller- authored,"
" never selected by a factory. Positive event capacity and 1..8-byte service "
"batches match this bounded SDR/IBI reference. No legacy I2C, DMA, HDR, target"
" role, implicit discovery or hidden event worker."
msgstr ""
"拒绝重叠、未对齐、地址运算溢出的存储、重复 PID／地址、I3C 保留地址及非零目标。config "
"值被复制，无需继续存活；但其引用的存储与上下文须保持存活，并与每个请求／载荷／输出分离。48 位 PID 由调用方编写，绝不由工厂选择。正数事件容量及 "
"1..8 字节 service 批次对应此有界 SDR/IBI 参考。不支持传统 I2C、DMA、HDR、目标角色、隐式发现或隐藏事件工作线程。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid "Authored immutable target policy, not runtime factory discovery."
msgstr "预先编写的不可变目标策略，不是运行时工厂发现。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid "Caller-owned target record, zero-initialized once."
msgstr "调用方拥有的目标记录，仅零初始化一次。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid ""
"Core retains tentative and confirmed addresses on DAA error. Epoch never "
"resets or wraps, including after bus reset."
msgstr "DAA 出错时核心保留暂定及已确认地址。纪元从不重置或回绕，包括总线复位后。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid "Value command; begin copies it synchronously and retains no pointer."
msgstr "值命令；begin 同步复制，不保留指针。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid "One bounded hardware observation and aggregate FIFO progress."
msgstr "单次有界硬件观察及聚合 FIFO 进度。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid ""
"No callback retains spans. tx/rx counts may not exceed the supplied "
"capacities. DAA acknowledged confirms the preceding assignment BEFORE any "
"next identity in this observation. A complete DAA with a tentative "
"unacknowledged address is an error, never implicit success. Event data are "
"fully copied."
msgstr ""
"任何回调均不保留跨度。tx/rx 计数不得超过提供的容量。本次观察中，DAA 确认必须先确认此前的地址分配，再处理下一个身份。若 DAA "
"完成时仍有未确认的暂定地址，则是错误，绝不视为隐式成功。事件数据全部复制。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid "Synchronous bounded hardware leaves; no request forwarding."
msgstr "同步有界硬件叶操作；不转发请求。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid ""
"begin and assign are infallible commands. pump reports later hardware "
"failures and services at most the supplied payload batch capacities, one "
"fixed eight-byte DAA identity, one IBI and one hot-join latch. Identity "
"metadata does not contribute to transmitted/received payload counts. No "
"command or span is retained. No application code is called. withdraw requests"
" abort. quiescent SUCCESS proves actual wire/FIFO/IRQ quiescence and all port"
" observers detached."
msgstr ""
"begin 和 assign 是不会失败的命令。pump 报告后续硬件错误，每次最多处理给定载荷批次容量、一条固定八字节 DAA 身份、一条 IBI "
"和一个 hot-join 锁存。身份元数据不计入 transmitted/received "
"载荷计数。不保留命令或区间指针，不调用应用代码。withdraw 请求中止。quiescent SUCCESS 证明实际线上/FIFO/IRQ "
"已静默，且所有端口观察者均已脱离。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid ""
"reset additionally proves EVERY target dynamic address invalidated. FIFO "
"flush or controller reset alone cannot report SUCCESS. BUSY/IO/UNSUPPORTED "
"proof retains loans and ownership. release is infallible after successful "
"final quiescence; it must not silently refuse ownership transfer or repeat a "
"fallible proof while the core publishes join. The port context and supplied "
"storage outlive observers."
msgstr ""
"reset 还必须证明每个目标的动态地址均已失效。仅刷新 FIFO 或复位控制器不得返回 SUCCESS。BUSY/IO/UNSUPPORTED "
"证明保留借用和所有权。最终静默成功后的 release 不得失败；核心发布 join 时，它不得静默拒绝所有权转交，也不得重复执行可能失败的证明。端口 "
"context 和所提供的存储必须存活到观察者全部退出之后。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid ""
"All port/clock callbacks are non-reentrant: no core calls, application calls "
"or mutation of retained core state. claim atomically acquires an exclusive "
"controller and its IRQ/clock/pins. SUCCESS requires independently established"
" proof that EVERY target dynamic address is invalidated, including targets "
"still powered across MCU reset. The caller establishes this baseline before "
"construction; claim never attempts an unproven reset. Rejection has no "
"effects. ready is a read-only admission check."
msgstr ""
"全部端口／时钟回调均不可重入：不得调用核心、调用应用代码或修改核心保留状态。claim 原子地取得控制器及其 "
"IRQ／时钟／引脚的独占所有权。SUCCESS 要求独立建立证明：每个目标的动态地址都已失效，包括 MCU "
"复位期间仍保持供电的目标。调用方须在构造前建立此基线；claim 绝不尝试未经证明的复位。拒绝不产生效果。ready 是只读接纳检查。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:137
msgid "Exact caller capacities; separate static controller and target data."
msgstr "调用方的精确容量；静态控制器与目标数据分离。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:143
msgid "f407_i2s2_slave_tx.h"
msgstr "f407_i2s2_slave_tx.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "Exact F407 finite stereo16 I2S2 slave transmitter."
msgstr "精确面向 F407 的有限 stereo16 I2S2 从机发送器。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "Fixed chip resource selected by the same validated hardware IR."
msgstr "由同一份已验证硬件 IR 选定的固定芯片资源。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "Acquire the selected F407 SPI2 personality and fixed pads."
msgstr "取得选定 F407 SPI2 工作模式及固定引脚的所有权。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid ""
"The caller owns the external master and holds CK idle LOW and WS HIGH "
"continuously from before initialization/submission until acquire-observed "
"ACTIVE. Pin reads sample instants; they cannot prove electrical silence. The "
"master transmits exactly the declared complete frames and stops before a "
"missing next word. Restart begins at the left channel. A prefilling "
"cancellation with CK idle cannot empty DR; preserve QUARANTINED storage until"
" coordinated drain clocks allow TXE then fresh BSY observations. This error "
"drain can underrun and does not promise valid stereo audio or a complete "
"transmitted frame; errors report zero transferred bytes. Timeout, TC or NDTR0"
" never proves wire completion or final access. The caller also supplies valid"
" operating voltage, I/O levels, load, CK/WS/SD timing and DMA refill margin "
"under DS8626. ACTIVE and pin samples do not measure or qualify those "
"electrical/rate conditions."
msgstr ""
"调用方拥有外部主机，并且从初始化或提交之前开始，持续保持 CK 处于空闲 LOW、WS 处于 HIGH，直到以 acquire 语义观察到 "
"ACTIVE。引脚读取只反映采样瞬间，不能证明电气信号持续静止。主机必须恰好传输所声明的完整帧，并在需要下一个尚未提供的数据字之前停止。再次启动时从左声道开始。已预填充时，若取消请求且"
" CK 仍保持空闲，DR 便无法排空；必须保留处于 QUARANTINED 的存储，直到协调提供的排空时钟允许先观察 TXE，再重新观察 "
"BSY。这种错误排空可能产生欠载，并不保证得到有效的立体声音频或发送完整帧；错误一律报告零传输字节。超时、TC 或 NDTR0 "
"都不能证明线上发送完成或已完成最终访问。调用方还必须按 DS8626 提供有效的工作电压、I/O 电平、负载、CK/WS/SD 时序和 DMA "
"补充数据裕量。ACTIVE 和引脚采样既不测量这些电气或速率条件，也不构成对它们的验证。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid ""
"One privileged unmasked task serializes every method and external owner "
"lifecycle. Preserve incoming masks on all rejection paths. NMI/HardFault, "
"other DMA/IRQ/pin owners, reset/reclock/debugger writers and concurrent "
"Platform stop are excluded. Observed reset or clock-profile history loss "
"while borrowed permanently retains the request; restoring reset-looking "
"registers cannot establish prior final access. Main SRAM is DMA-visible; CCM "
"is not. Chip pin capability establishes neither a PCB route nor "
"codec/electrical HIL. The assembly and fixture supply the actual F407/package"
" identity: shared device-group and density reads alone do not distinguish an "
"F405 or authenticate the physical package."
msgstr ""
"由一个未屏蔽中断的特权任务串行执行所有方法，并串行管理外部所有者的生命周期。所有拒绝路径都必须保留调用前的中断屏蔽状态。不允许从 "
"NMI/HardFault 调用，也不允许其他 DMA/IRQ/引脚所有者、复位或重配时钟的写入方、调试器写入方以及并发 Platform stop "
"介入。借用期间一旦观察到复位或时钟配置历史丢失，请求就会被永久保留；将寄存器恢复成复位时的样子不能证明此前已经完成最终访问。主 SRAM 对 DMA "
"可见；CCM 不可见。芯片引脚能力既不能证明 PCB 布线，也不代表已经完成编解码器或电气 HIL 验证。实际的 F407 "
"及封装身份由装配配置和测试夹具确定：仅凭共用的器件组标识和容量读数，既不能区分 F405 与 F407，也不能验证物理封装。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid ""
"Exact F407VE/ZG, baremetal, HSE8/PLL168 and live TIM2 only. The normal "
"hardware role exclusively claims SPI2/I2S2, PB12 WS/PB13 CK/PB15 SD AF5, DMA1"
" Stream4 channel0 and both vectors. No PLLI2S, continuous DBM or IRQ service "
"is enabled. Peripheral/pad/SPI2 gate ownership lasts until stop SUCCESS, "
"independently of each request's shorter frame loan. The selected cold-reset "
"Platform separately holds the shared GPIOB/DMA1 gates. Initialization "
"requires both already on; this provider never enables or withdraws them. "
"Every shared domain user, including external HAL users, must join before "
"Platform stop. Clock-gating is not proof of a reset engine; unknown running-"
"state attachment is unsupported."
msgstr ""
"仅支持精确的 F407VE/ZG 器件、baremetal、HSE8/PLL168 以及有效运行中的 TIM2。常规硬件角色以独占方式声明 "
"SPI2/I2S2、PB12 WS/PB13 CK/PB15 SD AF5、DMA1 Stream4 channel0 及两个向量。不启用 "
"PLLI2S、连续 DBM 或 IRQ 服务。外设、引脚和 SPI2 时钟门控的所有权一直保留到 stop 返回 "
"SUCCESS，独立于每个请求持续时间较短的帧借用。选定的冷复位 Platform 单独持有共享的 GPIOB/DMA1 "
"时钟门控。初始化要求这两个门控已经开启；本提供方绝不启用或撤回它们。所有共享域使用者，包括外部 HAL 使用者，都必须在 Platform stop "
"前完成活动并汇合退出。时钟门控状态不能证明引擎已经复位；不支持接管运行状态未知的硬件。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "[inout] Fresh zero storage, disjoint from all controls."
msgstr "[inout] 全新的零初始化存储，且与所有控制对象的存储范围互不重叠。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "[in] Stable readonly {&nx_f407_i2s2_slave_tx_ops, storage}."
msgstr "[in] 地址稳定且只读的 {&nx_f407_i2s2_slave_tx_ops, storage}。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "[in] Fixed resource and observation budget."
msgstr "[in] 固定资源及观察预算。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID, CONTEXT, BUSY, STATE, UNSUPPORTED or IO. Initialization IO "
"retains cleanup responsibility; call stop before reuse."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS、INVALID、CONTEXT、BUSY、STATE、UNSUPPORTED 或 IO。初始化返回 IO 时仍保留清理责任；复用前须调用 "
"stop。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "Shared immutable methods; callbacks receive the storage context."
msgstr "共享且不可变的方法表；回调接收存储上下文。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "One complete contiguous interleaved stereo16 frame block."
msgstr "一个完整、连续且交错存储的 stereo16 帧块。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid ""
"Initialize and prepare base with the ordinary helpers. The source has one "
"plane of contiguous nonempty rows, no offset or padding, and 4..131068 bytes "
"in a multiple of four. Each frame stores left then right 16-bit little-endian"
" samples. The fixed Philips I2S wire emits each sample MSB first in 16-bit "
"slots. Sample values, rate, codec and external clocks are caller policy. "
"Acceptance transfers the exact immutable source loan and borrows this request"
" until acquire-observed SETTLED. Never separately release, mutate or reuse "
"accepted storage. SUCCESS reports the whole block only after memory and wire "
"completion. Every error or cancellation reports zero; the DMA count does not "
"establish serialized audio bytes."
msgstr ""
"使用常规辅助函数初始化并准备 base。源数据由一个平面内的连续非空行组成，没有偏移或填充，大小为 4..131068 "
"字节且必须是四的倍数。每帧按先左声道、后右声道的顺序存放 16 位小端采样。固定的 Philips I2S 线上格式使用 16 位时隙，并以 MSB "
"优先的顺序发送每个采样。采样值、速率、编解码器和外部时钟均由调用方决定。接受请求时会移交该确切且不可变的源帧借用，并借用此请求，直至以 acquire "
"语义观察到 SETTLED。不得自行释放、修改或复用已接受的存储。只有在内存传输和线上发送均完成后，SUCCESS "
"才报告整个块的字节数。任何错误或取消均报告零字节；DMA 计数无法证明已经串行发送的音频字节数。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "One privileged serialized task executor; no ISR callback."
msgstr "由一个特权任务串行执行所有操作；不提供 ISR 回调。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid ""
"submit SUCCESS means ACCEPTED, including subsequent setup failure. QUEUED is "
"not armed. Acquire-observed ACTIVE alone authorizes the external master to "
"begin CK, after one DR halfword and a live TIM2 interval have been observed. "
"Error, cancellation or timeout retains the full loan until actual engine, "
"serializer, vector and address withdrawal. service returns SUCCESS when idle "
"or settled, otherwise BUSY or an observed failure with the borrow retained. "
"stop closes further admission and requests cancellation; repeat it after "
"service proves the remaining cleanup. The first SR observation occurs only "
"after acceptance because reading SR clears UDR/FRE. Its fault remains latched"
" through cleanup; a later clean status read cannot erase the operation's "
"cause. No method allocates, starts a task or replays a block. Admission "
"checks controls against every full-capacity pool slot in O(slot count); "
"service/cancel do not scan the pool."
msgstr ""
"submit 返回 SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED，即使后续设置失败也不改变这一含义。QUEUED 尚未完成就绪准备。只有在观察到 DR "
"中已有一个半字且有效运行的 TIM2 已经过所需间隔后，以 acquire 语义观察到 ACTIVE，才允许外部主机开始提供 "
"CK。发生错误、取消或超时时，仍保留完整借用，直到实际完成 DMA 引擎、串行发送器、向量和地址引用的撤回。service 在空闲或请求已终结时返回 "
"SUCCESS；否则返回 BUSY 或观察到的失败状态，同时继续保留借用。stop 关闭后续请求接纳并请求取消；待 service "
"证明剩余清理已经完成后，再次调用 stop。由于读取 SR 会清除 UDR/FRE，请求的首次 SR "
"观察仅在接受后发生。观察到的故障在整个清理过程中保持锁存；后续无故障的状态读取不能抹去本次操作的失败原因。任何方法都不分配内存、不启动任务，也不重放数据块。接纳请求时，会以"
" O(slot count) 的复杂度检查控制对象是否与池中每个槽位的完整容量范围重叠；service/cancel 不扫描该池。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "Immutable caller-owned face; private state is separate."
msgstr "由调用方持有的不可变接口对象；私有状态单独存放。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "Exact resource and positive bounded observation budget."
msgstr "精确选定的资源，以及为正数的有界观察预算。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid ""
"poll_limit bounds each arm/drain observation loop, not time or external-clock"
" progress. Arming observes at least three actual 1 MHz TIM2 ticks after I2SE "
"readback. Deadlines are absolute in the current live Platform TIM2 epoch. The"
" caller stops and joins this owner before Platform stop/restart; the deadline"
" includes wire and observer withdrawal. No automatic ClockDomain enrollment "
"is implied."
msgstr ""
"poll_limit 限制每次就绪准备或排空观察循环的次数，并不表示经过的时间，也不保证外部时钟推进。就绪准备必须在 I2SE 读回后观察到至少三个实际的"
" 1 MHz TIM2 计数推进。截止时间是当前有效 Platform TIM2 "
"时间纪元内的绝对时间。调用方必须先停止该所有者并等待其活动完全结束，再执行 Platform "
"stop/restart；截止时间也涵盖线上发送排空和观察者撤回。这里并不意味着会自动加入 ClockDomain。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid "Exact storage for one owner, zeroed once before publication."
msgstr "供一个所有者使用的精确大小存储，在发布前完成一次清零。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:145
msgid ""
"Do not copy or alter. Keep storage and face live through successful stop. "
"Accepted request/source loans last until acquire-observed SETTLED; a failed "
"stop never revokes an unfinished borrow."
msgstr ""
"不得复制或修改。存储和接口对象必须始终保持有效，直到 stop 成功。已接受的请求及源帧借用一直保留到以 acquire 语义观察到 "
"SETTLED；stop 失败绝不撤销尚未结束的借用。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:151
msgid "MCUboot control and explicit Flash composition"
msgstr "MCUboot 控制与显式 Flash 装配"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:153
msgid ""
"`Nexus::MCUBootControl` exposes the stateless public control API below. It "
"uses only Nexus types. `Nexus::MCUBootPort` is the separate, concrete Flash "
"composition boundary; `Nexus::MCUBootBootStorage` belongs to a separately "
"linked boot image. These targets are outside the default platform assembly."
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::MCUBootControl` 暴露下述无状态公共控制 API，仅使用 Nexus 类型。`Nexus::MCUBootPort` "
"是独立的具体 Flash 装配边界；`Nexus::MCUBootBootStorage` 属于独立链接的 boot 镜像。这些 target "
"均不属于默认平台装配。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:158
msgid ""
"Use the [canonical MCUboot contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/mcuboot/README.md) for "
"helper selection, the boot/application ownership diagram, finite operation "
"and Flash-region lifetime, partial persistent writes and product recovery "
"duties. The selected overwrite-only profile supports permanent requests; the "
"control API does not authenticate a candidate, reset hardware or provide "
"rollback. Software models and linked-image budgets do not establish physical "
"Flash, power-cut or HIL qualification."
msgstr ""
"helper 选择、boot／应用所有权图、有限 operation 与 Flash region 生命周期、部分持久写入和产品恢复责任，以 "
"[MCUboot 权威合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/mcuboot/README.md)为准。所选覆盖配置支持永久更新请求；控制 API "
"不鉴别候选镜像、不复位硬件，也不提供回滚。软件模型与已链接镜像预算不建立物理 Flash、掉电或 HIL 资格。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:168
msgid "mcuboot_control.h"
msgstr "mcuboot_control.h"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid "Stateless control of a fixed MCUboot overwrite-only image."
msgstr "固定 MCUboot 覆盖镜像的无状态控制。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid ""
"The selected single-image profile supports permanent requests only. This API "
"neither downloads nor verifies an image, resets hardware, confirms a trial "
"image, or provides rollback. Applications own authorization, valid candidate "
"bytes, maintenance scheduling, platform lifetime and reset policy. Author  "
"Nexus Team"
msgstr ""
"所选单镜像配置仅支持永久更新请求。此 API "
"不下载或校验镜像、不复位硬件、不确认试运行镜像，也不提供回滚。应用负责授权、有效候选字节、维护调度、平台生命周期和复位策略。作者  Nexus Team"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid "Requested upgrade behavior; TEST is explicitly unsupported."
msgstr "请求的更新行为；明确不支持 TEST。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid "Upstream observed action, not a physical or image-health verdict."
msgstr "上游观察到的动作，不是物理或镜像健康结论。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid ""
"TEST and REVERT can be observed in foreign trailer metadata; their presence "
"does not add support for those modes to overwrite-only firmware."
msgstr "外部 trailer 元数据中可能观察到 TEST 和 REVERT；出现这些值不会为覆盖模式固件增加相应模式支持。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid "Query upstream's planned action for image zero."
msgstr "查询上游对镜像零的计划动作。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid ""
"Task/boot context only. Caller serializes access and supplies the immutable "
"Flash operation hook and its finite deadline for the whole call. All "
"referenced areas, regions, clock and provider remain alive through return. "
"The pinned upstream API treats an unreadable secondary trailer as empty; NONE"
" therefore does not establish secondary availability or image validity."
msgstr ""
"仅限 task／boot 上下文。调用方串行化访问，为整个调用提供不可变 Flash operation hook 及其有限 "
"deadline。所有被引用的 area、region、时钟与 provider 持续存活至返回。固定上游 API 将不可读的 secondary "
"trailer 视为空，因此 NONE 不能证明 secondary 可用或镜像有效。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid "Receives a value on success only; never retained."
msgstr "仅在成功时接收值；不保留该指针。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid ""
"NX_SUCCESS for a known action, NX_ERROR_INVALID for NULL, or NX_ERROR_IO for "
"upstream PANIC, an unknown value or a reported read error."
msgstr ""
"已知动作返回 NX_SUCCESS，NULL 返回 NX_ERROR_INVALID，上游 PANIC、未知值或报告的读取错误返回 "
"NX_ERROR_IO。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid "Request a permanent upgrade using the upstream public trailer API."
msgstr "使用上游公共 trailer API 请求永久更新。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid ""
"Same serialized finite operation/lifetime contract as query. Return settles "
"current Flash access; a timeout is not a physical pulse abort. This does not "
"prove candidate authenticity, promise old-image recovery, renew the deadline,"
" stop infrastructure or reset the MCU."
msgstr ""
"沿用 query 的串行化、有限 operation 与生命周期合同。返回时当前 Flash "
"访问已结清；超时不是中止物理脉冲。该调用不证明候选真实性、不承诺恢复旧镜像、不续期 deadline、不停止基础设施，也不复位 MCU。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid "PERMANENT requests an update; TEST rejects without access."
msgstr "PERMANENT 请求更新；TEST 无访问即拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/api/extension-components.md:170
msgid ""
"NX_SUCCESS after upstream completes and reports PERMANENT on readback, "
"NX_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED for TEST, NX_ERROR_INVALID for an unknown request, "
"NX_ERROR_STATE for another known readback action, or NX_ERROR_IO for an "
"upstream error. An error can follow partial persistent trailer modification, "
"including a pending TEST that cannot be silently promoted."
msgstr ""
"上游完成且读回报告 PERMANENT 后返回 NX_SUCCESS；TEST 返回 NX_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED，未知请求返回 "
"NX_ERROR_INVALID，读回其他已知动作返回 NX_ERROR_STATE，上游错误返回 NX_ERROR_IO。部分持久 trailer "
"修改后仍可能返回错误，包括不能悄悄提升为永久更新的 pending TEST。"
